{"id":"3f7a2eae516684d4","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-alg-magma.md","title":"ZFC Alg Magma","display":"df-zfc-alg-magma — ZFC Alg Magma","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-alg-magma","aliases":["58-df-zfc-alg-magma"],"display":"df-zfc-alg-magma — ZFC Alg Magma","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-algebra]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-product]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-alg-magma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-alg-magma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-alg-magma — ZFC Alg Magma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573b416d39297a97\" href=\"?note=573b416d39297a97\" title=\"58-df-algebra\">58-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3579e07be41aa5cd\" href=\"?note=3579e07be41aa5cd\" title=\"58-df-product\">58-df-product</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\ast\\in V\">\\(M,\\ast\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgMagma}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgMagma}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}magma} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgMagma}_S(M,\\ast)\\leftrightarrow M\\neq\\emptyset\\land \\mathrm{Function}(\\ast,M\\times M,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}magma} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgMagma}_S(M,\\ast)\\leftrightarrow M\\neq\\emptyset\\land \\mathrm{Function}(\\ast,M\\times M,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A magma is a nonempty carrier equipped with a total binary operation whose graph has domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\times M\">\\(M\\times M\\)</span> and codomain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The function-graph predicate replaces the untyped arrow notation in the former assertion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"573b416d39297a97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"3579e07be41aa5cd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"M,\\ast\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgMagma}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}magma} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgMagma}_S(M,\\ast)\\leftrightarrow M\\neq\\emptyset\\land \\mathrm{Function}(\\ast,M\\times M,M)","display":true},{"tex":"M\\times M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":922,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1415","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-alg-magma.md|58-df-zfc-alg-magma]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","573b416d39297a97","36d7463d215be751","3579e07be41aa5cd"]}